{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the eerie wilderness in <i>Raccoon Hunter</i>, a chilling horror-hunting experience about a man and his mysterious pet lurking beneath the well. Armed with a double-barreled shotgun and a trusty axe, you must hunt raccoons to keep your pet fed or you might be next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Raccoon Hunter</i> you can..</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt raccoons in the woods to feed your pet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect varying amounts of raccoon meat each day based on your pet\u2019s  hunger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the wild, but beware of wolves and other threats that roam the forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt birds to restore your health when you're injured.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story behind the creature in the well and your twisted connection to it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3376710?t=1759314894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3376710?t=1759314894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376710/d16728f78c6eb9ac9eb9625d2d1706c6119c485f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759314894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376710/d16728f78c6eb9ac9eb9625d2d1706c6119c485f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759314894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains blood, gore and other mature content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the eerie wilderness in <i>Raccoon Hunter</i>, a chilling horror-hunting experience abo